        {
          "id": 733701042,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I don't know if \"improve\" was the best word to put in the commit message for a style change, but the layout used is certainly more logical than before.\n\nHowever the information was already all there. My patch and comment just made the issue you point out more apparent.",
